Package: typst
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: markup-based typesetting system
 Typst compiles marked-up text documents to PDF, SVG or PNG. Common
 formatting is concise markup; everything beyond it is scriptable in
 the same language, and errors are reported against source locations.
 A watch mode recompiles incrementally on save.
